{
	"_comment": [
		"The display patch of the site keyboard: what the Ergopti layout source",
		"(static/layouts/sources/ergopti.toml) cannot say. tools/codegen/codegen-site-keyboard.cjs",
		"applies it to the source and writes static/layouts/visualisation/ergopti_v2.2.json.",
		"levels: the source layer of each text level. dead_levels: each dead key by its terminator.",
		"level_order: the levels of every key. iso, ergodox: the drawings (row, column, size, hand, finger).",
		"keys: one entry per drawn key. A key with « source » takes its text levels and dead-key levels",
		"from that source key; « display » replaces a source cell by a stand-in; « extra » holds the",
		"levels the source does not own (Ctrl beyond letters and digits, the Ergopti+ levels « …+ »,",
		"Layer, À and comma, their styles); the letters and digits take Ctrl from their base level.",
		"A key without « source » shows « all » on every level and « all_plus » on every Ergopti+",
		"level, except what « extra » sets (null: no cell). The generator refuses a patch value that",
		"would hide a source value, so a layout change always reaches the site."
	],
	"name": "Ergopti v2.2",
	"site": "https://ergopti.fr",
